# ---- build artifacts (never commit; rebuilt by `pnpm run build`) ----
lib/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---- DSH isolated verification hosts (created by the tools that own them) ----
#
# `DSH_HOME=<workspace>/.probe-home-*` gives a completely isolated Harness home:
# its own profiles/, sessions/, storages/ and node_modules. Must never be
# committed, and deleting one is always safe — the owning tool rebuilds it.
#
# Each tool gets its OWN home because the tools delete and recreate them: a
# shared path means one probe wipes another probe's fixtures mid-run.
#
# NOTE: gitignore does NOT support trailing inline comments. A line like
# `.probe-home/   # comment` is a literal pattern that matches nothing, which
# is exactly how a credentials file nearly got committed once. Keep every
# pattern alone on its line.
.probe-home-scaffold/
.probe-home/
# Raw probe/dump transcripts produced by tools/probe-host.mjs.
.probe-out-scaffold/
.probe-out/

# ---- credentials: never committable, wherever a probe home puts them ----
.credentials.yaml
**/.credentials.yaml
**/.credentials*

# ---- package-manager state (redirected here by .npmrc) ----
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-cache/
.pnpm-state/
node_modules/

# ---- misc ----
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage/
